body.zh:
- 兩個事件把樣本空間分成四區，四個數目加起來就是 $S$ 的總數：{{math:0}}
- 「至少一個」＝只 $A$、只 $B$、兩者都有，三區相加；反面算法是用總數減去「兩者都不是」：{{math:1}}
- 把數字直接寫在圖中對應區域，比只寫算式更容易看出有無漏掉或重複。
- 已知總數時，最後一格通常用減法得出：$S$ 的總數減去另外三區。

body.en:
- Two events split the sample space into four regions; the four numbers add up to n(S): {{math:0}}
- "At least one" means A only, B only and both, added together; the complement method takes the total and subtracts "neither": {{math:1}}
- Writing the numbers straight into the regions makes any missing or double-counted group visible.
- When the total is known, the last cell is found by subtraction: n(S) minus the other three regions.

body.zh:
- 若每個結果出現的機會相同，事件 $A$ 的概率就是 {{math:0}}
- $P(A)$ 一定在 0 與 1 之間：必然事件 $P(S) = 1$、不可能事件 $P(\varnothing) = 0$。
- 補集的概率＝「唔中」＝ 1 減去「中」：{{math:1}}
- 數 $n(A)$ 時只數 $A$ 之內的結果，$n(S)$ 是全部可能結果的數目；兩者都要數對，分母才正確。

body.en:
- If every outcome is equally likely, the probability of event A is {{math:0}}
- P(A) always lies between 0 and 1: the certain event has P(S) = 1 and the impossible event has P(∅) = 0.
- The probability of the complement is 1 minus the probability of the event: {{math:1}}
- Count n(A) as the outcomes inside A only, and n(S) as all possible outcomes; both counts must be right or the denominator is wrong.

body.zh:
- 若 $A \cap B = \varnothing$，兩個事件不會同時發生，稱為互斥；此時可以直接相加：{{math:0}}
- 若 $C$ 整個落在 $A$ 之內（$C \subset A$），則 $A \cap C = C$，而 $A \cup C = A$：{{math:1}}
- $A$ 與 $A'$ 既是互斥，合起來又正好是整個樣本空間：{{math:2}}
- 互斥與「兩者都不是」是相反的兩種情況：互斥指「同時中」，兩者都不是指「兩個都不中」；兩者都會令文氏圖出現空格。

body.en:
- If A ∩ B = ∅ the two events cannot happen at the same time and are called mutually exclusive; then the counts may simply be added: {{math:0}}
- If C lies completely inside A (C ⊂ A), then A ∩ C = C and A ∪ C = A: {{math:1}}
- A and A′ are mutually exclusive and together they fill the whole sample space: {{math:2}}
- "Mutually exclusive" and "neither" are opposites: the first means both at once, the second means neither one, and both leave a cell empty in the Venn diagram.
